Law Number 14 of 1950 concerning the Establishment of Regency Areas Within West Java Province (State Gazette of 1950) as amended by Law Number 4 of 1968 concerning the Establishment of Purwakarta Regency and Bekasi Regency by Amending Law Number 14 of 1950 concerning the Establishment of Regency Areas within West Java Province (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1968 Number 31, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 2851);

