NUMBER 5 REGIONAL GAZETTE

NUMBER 5 REGIONAL GAZETTE

Considering:

BEKASI REGENCY YEAR 2020

REGENT OF BEKASI

WEST JAVA PROVINCE

REGIONAL REGULATION OF BEKASI REGENCY

NUMBER 5 OF 2020

CONCERNING

PROTECTION OF WOMEN

BY THE GRACE OF ALMIGHTY GOD

THE REGENT OF BEKASI,

a. that women are assets who play a very important role in the process of continuation and creation of quality generations so they need to receive protection guarantees from acts of violence and discrimination and need to be empowered in order to actualize their potential optimally;

b. that in order to realize the fulfillment of women's constitutional rights to be free from torture, treatment that degrades human dignity, the right to obtain security and freedom from all violence and to improve the quality of life of women, they need to receive protection and empowerment from the regional government of Bekasi Regency; C. that the implementation of protection of women in Bekasi Regency has not been carried out optimally and is accompanied by violations of women's rights, therefore comprehensive regulations are needed to provide direction, foundation, and legal certainty;

d. that based on the considerations as referred to in letter a, letter b, and letter c, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation on the Protection of Women;

In view of:

1.

2.

3.

Article 18 paragraph (6) of the 1945 Constitution of the Republic of Indonesia;

Law Number 14 of 1950 concerning the Establishment of Regency Areas Within West Java Province (State Gazette of 1950) as amended by Law Number 4 of 1968 concerning the Establishment of Purwakarta Regency and Bekasi Regency by Amending Law Number 14 of 1950 concerning the Establishment of Regency Areas within West Java Province (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1968 Number 31, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 2851);

Law Number 7 of 1984 concerning Ratification of the Convention on the Elimination of All Forms of Discrimination Against Women (Convention on the Elimination of All Forms of Discrimination Against Women) (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia year 1948 Number 29, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3277);

2. Law Number 39 of 1999 concerning Human Rights (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1999 Number 165, Supplement to the State Gazette Number 3886);

3. Law Number 23 of 2004 concerning the Elimination of Domestic Violence (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2004 Number 95, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4419);

4.

Law Number 13 of 2006 concerning the Protection of Witnesses and Victims (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2006 Number 64, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4635) as amended by Law Number 31 of 2014 concerning Amendments to Law Number 13 of 2006 concerning the Protection of Witnesses and Victims (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2014 Number 293, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5602);

5.

Law Number 36 of 2009 concerning Health (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2009 Number 144, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5063);

